Server init.
>> a := Blob haaraa: 4.
a bytes: ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob haaraa: 4.
b bytes: ( Tarree-wantootaa haaraa ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a haaraa.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Baʼii barreessi: ['xorred:'], dhaabi. 
Baʼii barreessi: n, dhaabi. 
} qabi: { :e Baʼii barreessi: e, dhaabi. }, fiigi.
a gadi-lakkisi.
b gadi-lakkisi.
